      "created_at": "2015-12-04T20:41:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So based off the last couple releases, more than likely end of February beginning or march. Even though multiplayer did slow them down a bit so who knows. I am hoping they are starting to tinker around with vengeance and how they want to do that since it will more than likely require some rewrites of the code.</p><p>&nbsp;Don't want to see a 4-6 month gap between vengeance and wrath because of that alone.</p>",
